cmu-guidance-no-ground-reports = No current ground reports
cmu-guidance-ground-report-sent = GPS ground report transmitted: ({$x}, {$y}).
cmu-guidance-ground-report-invalid = GPS reports require a ground observer on the planet, a measured target, and a recognized faction.
